# Schema applicator test fixtures must preserve exact byte layout across all
# platforms: the byte-identity test compares the C# engine's output (CRLF around
# BEGIN/END markers, LF inside snippets, original-file line endings elsewhere) to
# these fixtures, and `core.autocrlf` would otherwise rewrite line endings on
# checkout and break the test deterministically.
tests/Dabbler.SchemaApplicator.Tests/Fixtures/*.populated -text
tests/Dabbler.SchemaApplicator.Tests/Fixtures/*.template  -text
